## 🧪 Test Coverage Report

| Category | Coverage |
|----------|----------|
| Lines | ${LINES}% |
| Statements | ${STATEMENTS}% |
| Functions | ${FUNCTIONS}% |
| Branches | ${BRANCHES}% |

> [!NOTE]
> **How to read this:** percentages show how much of the code in `src/` was executed by the Vitest suite (V8 coverage). Lines and statements measure executed code, functions measure called functions, and branches measure taken `if`/ternary/`&&` paths. High coverage shows code was run, not that its behavior is correctly asserted.
>
> **What is excluded:** `src/app/**`, `src/components/ui/**`, `src/types/**`, `*.d.ts` and `*.config.ts` are not counted (see `vitest.config.mts`).
>
> **Further reading:** [Vitest coverage guide](https://vitest.dev/guide/coverage).
